sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    actor Performer as 사용자 / 센서
    participant Web as Web (Svelte / p5.js / WebAudio)
    participant Visual as Visual (GenAI / 3D / AE)
    participant Audio as Audio (Max / Bitwig)
    
    box rgb(16, 34, 38) CORE SYSTEM
        participant TD as TouchDesigner
        participant MID as OSC / MIDI Bridge
        participant Ableton as Ableton Live
    end
    
    participant Out as Outputs (Media / Live / Installation)

    %% 1. Trigger Phase
    Note over Performer, Web: 1. Input Trigger Phase
    Performer->>TD: 1. Tracking / Sensor Data Stream
    Performer->>Ableton: 2. Hardware / Controller MIDI Signals
    Web->>TD: 3. WebSocket / Web OSC Data

    %% 2. Generation & Core Sync
    Note over Visual, Audio: 2. Core Processing & Sync
    Visual->>TD: Frame Texture / 3D Data
    Audio->>Ableton: Multi-channel Audio Stream

    rect rgb(20, 28, 35)
        Note over TD, Ableton: Real-time Sync Loop (OSC / MIDI)
        TD->>MID: Send Visual Sync & Motion Data (OSC)
        MID->>Ableton: Route Parameter Control
        Ableton->>MID: Send Audio Beat / Envelope (MIDI/OSC)
        MID->>TD: Route Reactive Modulation
    end

    %% 3. Output Phase
    Note over TD, Out: 3. Final Signal Render
    par Parallel Output Generation
        TD->>Out: Real-time Visuals (Installation / Media)
        Ableton->>Out: Live Multi-channel Audio Output
    end
